WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
Hey, Conan O'Brien here.

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.610
And I'd like to
specifically talk right now

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:06.320
to the great state of Arizona.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.130
Listen up 'Zonans, put down those crystals

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.690
and stop staring into
the majestic Grand Canyon

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.580
'cause I have a message for you.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.240
There's an election this November,

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.860
so make sure you're registered to vote.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.570
Now I know Arizona is so excited

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:22.030
that you might not have
even heard of the election.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:24.330
Being so busy with your bolo ties

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.660
and your teal arch McDonald's.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.220
But it's time to make your
voice heard somewhere besides

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:32.910
an epic ASU vs. U of A football game.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.440
And yes, I know it's hard
to find time to register

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.680
between partying on houseboats,

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.740
exporting precious natural resources

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.410
like copper, turquoise, and Emma Stone.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:44.670
Taking care of three
gorgeous national parks,

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:48.190
explaining, "but it's a dry
heat" to everyone that visits,

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.739
and challenging tumbleweeds to duels.

00:00:50.739 --> 00:00:53.470
(flute plays)

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.120
But it's still important to our democracy.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.890
Plus you're the only
state that didn't fall

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:00.550
for the scam that is daylight savings.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.660
Which means the people
of Arizona aren't fools

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.210
like the rest of us.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.710
So Arizona, make sure you're registered.

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:08.851
The deadline for voter
registration is October 5th.

00:01:13.783 --> 00:01:16.450
Take all that positive
Sedona vortex energy

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:19.590
and let it carry your spirit to the polls.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:21.570
Trust me Arizona, the
only thing more delicious

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:24.076
than your Sonoran-style hot dogs

00:01:24.076 --> 00:01:27.113
is the sweet taste of democracy.

